240,238.37209302325581 240.50000000000003,238.39907192575407 241,238.42592592592592 241.5,238.4526558891455 242,238.47926267281105 242.50000000000003,238.50574712643677 243.00000000000003,238.5321100917431 243.49999999999997,238.55835240274598 244,238.58447488584474 244.49999999999997,238.61047835990888 245.00000000000003,238.63636363636363 245.49999999999997,238.66213151927437 246,238.68778280542986 246.5,238.7133182844244 247.00000000000003,238.73873873873873 247.49999999999997,238.7640449438202 248,238.78923766816143 248.5,238.81431767337807 249.00000000000003,238.83928571428572 249.49999999999997,238.8641425389755 250,238.88888888888889 250.5,238.91352549889135 251.00000000000003,238.93805309734512 251.5,238.962472406181 252,238.98678414096918 252.5,239.01098901098902 253.00000000000003,239.03508771929825 253.5,239.05908096280086 254,239.0829694323144 254.5,239.10675381263616 255.00000000000003,239.1304347826087 255.50000000000003,239.15401301518438 255.99999999999997,239.17748917748918 256.5,239.20086393088553 257,239.22413793103448 257.5,239.247311827957 258,239.27038626609442 258.5,239.2933618843683 259,239.31623931623932 259.5,239.33901918976545 260,239.36170212765958 260.5,239.38428874734606 261,239.40677966101694 261.5,239.42917547568712 262,239.45147679324896 262.5,239.47368421052633 263,239.49579831932772 263.5,239.51781970649895 264,239.5397489539749 264.5,239.5615866388309 265,239.58333333333334 265.5,239.6049896049896 266,239.6265560165975 266.5,239.648033126294 267,239.6694214876033 267.5,239.69072164948454 268,239.7119341563786 268.5,239.73305954825463 269,239.75409836065575 269.5,239.77505112474438 270,239.79591836734693 270.5,239.81670061099797 271,239.83739837398375 271.5,239.8580121703854 272,239.87854251012146 272.5,239.8989898989899 273,239.91935483870967 273.5,239.93963782696176 274,239.95983935742973 274.5,239.97995991983967 275,240\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"red\" stroke-width=\"1\"></polyline><circle cx=\"75\" cy=\"200\" r=\"3\" fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\"></circle><foreignObject x=\"137.5\" y=\"229.5\" width=\"28\" height=\"18\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><math><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></math></div></foreignObject></svg></svg><figcaption>Definition of <math><mrow><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"0.1667em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>.</figcaption></figure>","hidden":true,"type":"code"},{"input":"The definition implies that ``\\ln 1=0``, that ``\\ln x>0`` if ``x>1``, that ``\\ln x<0`` if ``0<x<1``, and that ``\\ln`` is a bijective function. We now show that if ``y=\\ln x``, then ``y^\\prime=\\frac{1}{x}``.\n\n::: proposition\nIf ``x>0``, then\n```math\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d} \\hphantom{x}}{\\mathrm{d} x}\\ln x=\\frac{1}{x}\\,.\n```\n:::\n\n\n","output":"","result":"The definition implies that ``\\ln 1=0``, that ``\\ln x>0`` if ``x>1``, that ``\\ln x<0`` if ``0<x<1``, and that ``\\ln`` is a bijective function. We now show that if ``y=\\ln x``, then ``y^\\prime=\\frac{1}{x}``.\n\n::: proposition\nIf ``x>0``, then\n```math\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d} \\hphantom{x}}{\\mathrm{d} x}\\ln x=\\frac{1}{x}\\,.\n```\n:::\n\n\n","resultHTML":"<p>The definition implies that <span class=\"math-tex\" data-type=\"tex\">\\(\\ln 1=0\\)</span>, that <span class=\"math-tex\" data-type=\"tex\">\\(\\ln x&gt;0\\)</span> if <span class=\"math-tex\" data-type=\"tex\">\\(x&gt;1\\)</span>, that <span class=\"math-tex\" data-type=\"tex\">\\(\\ln x&lt;0\\)</span> if <span class=\"math-tex\" data-type=\"tex\">\\(0&lt;x&lt;1\\)</span>, and that <span class=\"math-tex\" data-type=\"tex\">\\(\\ln\\)</span> is a bijective function. We now show that if <span class=\"math-tex\" data-type=\"tex\">\\(y=\\ln x\\)</span>, then <span class=\"math-tex\" data-type=\"tex\">\\(y^\\prime=\\frac{1}{x}\\)</span>.</p>\n<div data-type=\"proposition\">\n<p>If <span class=\"math-tex\" data-type=\"tex\">\\(x&gt;0\\)</span>, then</p>\n<div data-type=\"equation\" class=\"math-tex\">\n\\[\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d} \\hphantom{x}}{\\mathrm{d} x}\\ln x=\\frac{1}{x}\\,.\n\\]\n</div>\n</div>\n","hidden":true,"type":"markdown","translations":{},"translationSource":null},{"input":"const scale = 50;\nconst xmid = 85;\nconst ymid = 250;\nconst x = 0.5;\nconst h = 0.75;\n\nconst figure = JSCells.figure({\n  width: 340,\n  height: 285,\n  caption: \"Derivative of ln x.\",\n});\n\nconst X = (t) => xmid + t * scale;\nconst Y = (value) => ymid - value * scale;\n\n// Shaded area under 1/t.\nconst area = [`${X(x)},${ymid}`];\nfor (let i = 0; i <= 75; i++) {\n  const t = x + i * 0.01;\n  area.push(`${X(t)},${Y(1 / t)}`);\n}\narea.push(`${X(x + h)},${ymid}`);\nfigure.polygon().points(area.join(\" \")).fill(\"lightblue\").stroke(\"none\");\n\n// Axes and arrowheads.\nfigure.line().x1(65).y1(ymid).x2(335).y2(ymid).stroke(\"black\");\nfigure.line().x1(xmid).y1(275).x2(xmid).y2(5).stroke(\"black\");\nfigure.polygon().points(`335,${ymid} 328,${ymid - 4} 328,${ymid + 4}`).fill(\"black\");\nfigure.polygon().points(`${xmid},5 ${xmid - 4},12 ${xmid + 4},12`).fill(\"black\");\n\nfigure.label(\"t\", { x: 315, y: 220, width: 20, height: 28, latex: true });\nfigure.label(\"y\", { x: 93, y: 0, width: 20, height: 28, latex: true });\nfigure.label(\"O\", { x: 68, y: 252, width: 20, height: 28, latex: true });\n\nfor (const [value, label, left, width] of [\n  [x, \"x\", X(x) - 8, 24],\n  [x + h, \"x+h\", X(x + h) - 18, 45],\n]) {\n  figure.line().x1(X(value)).y1(ymid - 3).x2(X(value)).y2(ymid + 3).stroke(\"black\");\n  figure.label(label, { x: left, y: ymid + 4, width, height: 28, latex: true });\n}\n\nfor (const [value, label] of [\n  [1 / (x + h), String.raw`\\frac{1}{x+h}`],\n  [1 / x, String.raw`\\frac{1}{x}`],\n]) {\n  figure.line().x1(xmid - 3).y1(Y(value)).x2(xmid + 3).y2(Y(value)).stroke(\"black\");\n  figure.label(label, { x: 5, y: Y(value) - 18, width: 72, height: 40, latex: true });\n}\n\n// Curve and marked endpoints.\nconst curve = [];\nfor (let i = 1; i <= 500; i++) {\n  const t = i * 0.01;\n  curve.push(`${X(t)},${Y(1 / t)}`);\n}\nfigure.polyline().points(curve.join(\" \")).fill(\"none\").stroke(\"red\").strokeWidth(1);\nfor (const t of [x, x + h]) {\n  figure.circle().cx(X(t)).cy(Y(1 / t)).r(3).fill(\"red\").stroke(\"red\");\n}\n\n// Upper and lower rectangles.\nfor (const value of [1 / x, 1 / (x + h)]) {\n  figure.rect()\n    .x(X(x)).y(Y(value))\n    .width(h * scale).height(value * scale)\n    .fill(\"none\").stroke(\"deepskyblue\");\n}\n\nfigure;","output":"","result":"tyOxx+h1x+h1xDerivative of ln x.","resultHTML":"<figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"340\" height=\"285\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 285\"><polygon points=\"110,250 110,150 110.5,151.9607843137255 111,153.84615384615387 111.5,155.66037735849056 112,157.40740740740742 112.5,159.0909090909091 113,160.71428571428572 113.5,162.28070175438597 114,163.79310344827587 114.5,165.25423728813558 115,166.66666666666666 115.5,168.0327868852459 116,169.3548387096774 116.5,170.63492063492063 117,171.875 117.5,173.0769230769231 118,174.24242424242425 118.5,175.37313432835822 119,176.47058823529412 119.5,177.53623188405794 120,178.57142857142856 120.5,179.57746478873239 121,180.55555555555554 121.5,181.5068493150685 122,182.43243243243245 122.5,183.33333333333334 123,184.21052631578948 123.5,185.06493506493507 124,185.8974358974359 124.5,186.7088607594937 125,187.5 125.5,188.2716049382716 126,189.02439024390245 126.5,189.75903614457832 127,190.47619047619048 127.5,191.1764705882353 128,191.86046511627907 128.5,192.5287356321839 129,193.1818181818182 129.5,193.82022471910113 130,194.44444444444446 130.5,195.05494505494505 131,195.65217391304347 131.5,196.23655913978493 132,196.8085106382979 132.5,197.3684210526316 133,197.91666666666666 133.5,198.45360824742266 134,198.9795918367347 134.5,199.49494949494948 135,200 135.5,200.4950495049505 136,200.98039215686276 136.5,201.45631067961165 137,201.92307692307693 137.5,202.38095238095238 138,202.83018867924528 138.5,203.2710280373832 139,203.7037037037037 139.5